    question: String.raw`The differentiable functions $f$ and $g$ satisfy $f(1) = 2$, $f'(1) = 2$, $g(1) = -2$, and $g'(1) = 3$. If $h(x) = f(x)g(x)$, what is $h'(1)$?`,
